{"text":"Pero soy pobre y estoy necesitado.","poem":1},{"text":"Ven a mí rápidamente, Dios.","poem":2},{"text":"Tú eres mi ayuda y mi libertador.","poem":1},{"text":"Yahvé, no te demores.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/70.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/71.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/69.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}